Package: FlowSorted.DLPFC.450k
Version: 1.49.2
Title: Illumina HumanMethylation Data on Sorted Frontal Cortex Cell
        Populations
Description: Provides a function to download (and cache locally via
        BiocFileCache) a data object for the Illumina 450k DNA
        methylation microarrays. The underlying data is hosted on Zenodo.
